<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Orbis</title><description>Essays, briefs, slides, topics and durable knowledge.</description><link>https://raw.githack.com/XiaoDaoJiang/Orbis/preview-pr-27/</link><language>zh-CN</language><item><title>Agent 能力上升后，运行时边界正在从调用工具转向治理与可中断执行</title><link>https://raw.githack.com/XiaoDaoJiang/Orbis/preview-pr-27/briefs/2026-09-04/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://raw.githack.com/XiaoDaoJiang/Orbis/preview-pr-27/briefs/2026-09-04/</guid><description>GPT-6 Astra 把高能力模型带入更严格的安全门控，MCP 无状态化推动远程部署简化，而 Registry、Session 与 Approval 正在成为 Agent Harness 的核心工程边界。</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>agent-harness</category><category>coding-agent</category><category>mcp</category></item><item><title>Orbis Weekly — Presentation Becomes a Platform Boundary</title><link>https://raw.githack.com/XiaoDaoJiang/Orbis/preview-pr-27/briefs/2026-09-01-weekly/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://raw.githack.com/XiaoDaoJiang/Orbis/preview-pr-27/briefs/2026-09-01-weekly/</guid><description>A weekly judgment on how Orbis moved from a Daily-only slide path toward a reusable structured publishing and discovery platform.</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>agent-harness</category><category>coding-agent</category></item><item><title>Agent Harness 为什么成为系统竞争层</title><link>https://raw.githack.com/XiaoDaoJiang/Orbis/preview-pr-27/essays/agent-harness-system-layer/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://raw.githack.com/XiaoDaoJiang/Orbis/preview-pr-27/essays/agent-harness-system-layer/</guid><description>当模型逐渐商品化，状态、权限、环境和验证开始决定真实任务完成率。</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>agent-harness</category><category>coding-agent</category></item><item><title>Harness 正在成为模型之外的能力层</title><link>https://raw.githack.com/XiaoDaoJiang/Orbis/preview-pr-27/briefs/2026-08-28/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://raw.githack.com/XiaoDaoJiang/Orbis